WEBVTT

00:04:27.357 --> 00:04:30.639
A vredno je bilo iti na to potovanje.

00:04:30.639 --> 00:04:33.206
Na tej točki, to poletje,

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:36.671
vsi - znanstveniki, znanstveniki športa,

00:04:36.671 --> 00:04:41.230
strokovnjaki za vztrajnost, nevrologi,

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:45.555
moja ekipa, Bonnie -

00:04:45.555 --> 00:04:47.453
so rekli, da je nemogoče.

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:49.925
Enostavno je nemogoče
in Bonnie mi je rekla:

00:04:49.925 --> 00:04:51.964
"Ampak če boš šla na to potovanje,

00:04:51.964 --> 00:04:53.824
te bom pospremila do konca,

00:04:53.824 --> 00:04:55.299
tam bom."

00:04:55.299 --> 00:05:00.018
In zdaj smo tam.